OL,3,AUS to build two military bases in
OL,4,AGreenland under new deal with Denmark
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US, Denmark and Greenland have
OL,7,Fsigned a defence deal that allows
OL,8,FWashington to build two new military
OL,9,Fbases in the Arctic territory, while
OL,10,Freaffirming Copenhagen's sovereignty
OL,11,Fover it.
OL,13,FAt a signing ceremony at the UN General
OL,14,FAssembly in New York, US President
OL,15,FDonald Trump said "we will immediately
OL,16,Fbegin the process of developing a large
OL,17,Fmilitary presence in the appropriate
OL,18,Flocations".
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
